[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3810835150","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115506#issuecomment-3810835150","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115506","id":3810835150,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jJLrO","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T11:47:38Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T11:47:38Z","body":"CC @HolonProduction @KoBeWi ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3810835150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3810848579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115506#issuecomment-3810848579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115506","id":3810848579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jJO9D","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T11:50:39Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T11:50:39Z","body":"To cite myself from over on the PR\n> I personally don't think we can just hide those completly. For C++ there is an asymmetry: the classes are used in GDScript but they are never written in GDScript. This means there is no situation were you would want to access something private.\n>\n> For script members that's different. Not only the user code is written with autocompletion. Also the original code which works with private members is written with it. Hiding them without some sort of access resolution would make working with such classes easier, but it would make it annoying to develop classes with private members.\n>\n> And well, access resolution isn't exactly straight forward, if we want to do that, we should have consensus on behaviour first.\n>\n> Related:\n>\n> https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/93210\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103768","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3810848579/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811301092","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115506#issuecomment-3811301092","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115506","id":3811301092,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jK9bk","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T13:25:35Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T13:25:35Z","body":"There was a misunderstanding on what the PR did (including in [my comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112770#issuecomment-3805203057) 😅). \n\nThat PR was meant to hide only signals registered in core. We do the same with methods - underscored methods (excluding virtual) will not appear in documentation nor autocompletion. This allows to register internal API if needed, without exposing it to the user, so the compatibility is not a concern.\n\nThis does not apply to scripts, or at least not for autocompletion. You can autocomplete underscored signals and properties normally, but they don't appear in the documentation for the script. E.g.\n```GDScript\nsignal signal1\nsignal _signal2\n\nvar property1\nvar _property2\n```\n\n<img width=\"525\" height=\"481\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e554d39-834e-47bc-9f05-e40b841db324\" />\n\nSorry for the confusion. Closing in favor of #93210\nThere is a separate PR for that, which should also handle signals: #103768","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811301092/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3978908604","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115506#issuecomment-3978908604","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115506","id":3978908604,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tKVO8","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-01T02:40:57Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T02:55:50Z","body":"> Sorry for the confusion. Closing in favor of [#93210](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/93210) There is a separate PR for that, which should also handle signals: [#103768](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103768)\n\nThanks for your mention to this pr (#103768). However, It currently does not support hiding private signals from docs or editor pannels and I think that should be worth a new pr for that. What to achieve in this pr is purely to give you a safety warning/error that tells you not to do potential unsafe access in external scripts.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3978908604/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979491331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115506#issuecomment-3979491331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115506","id":3979491331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tMjgD","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-01T08:31:18Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T08:31:18Z","body":"IMO hiding this from the docs makes no sense without explicit virtual markers in GDScript. Otherwise you'd hide methods that are supposed to be overriden.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979491331/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]